hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"464","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Ibn Abi Mulaika se, Yala bin Mamlak se, Umm Darda se, Abu Darda se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jise narmi me se us ka hissa diya gaya use bhalai me se us ka hissa diya gaya, aur jo narmi me se apne hisse se mehrum rakha gaya woh bhalai me se apne hisse se mehrum rakha gaya, Qayamat ke din momin ke tarazu me sab se bhari cheez husn e akhlaq hai, aur beshak Allah Taala fahhsh badzaban se bugz rakhta hai."
"465","Abdullah bin Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr bin Nafe ne mujh se bayan kiya aur un ka naam Abu Bakr hai jo Zaid bin Khattab ke maula hain, unhon ne kaha: Maine Muhammad bin Abi Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm ko suna, Amra ne kaha: Ayesha ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Sahib e haisiyat logon ki laghzishon ko muaf karo."
"466","Ghudani Ahmad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kaseer bin Abi Kaseer ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Sakht mizaji kisi cheez me nahi hoti magar use aibdar karti hai, aur beshak Allah Rafiq hai narmi ko pasand karta hai."
"467","Amr bin Marzooq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hamein khabar di, Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah bin Abi Utba ko bayan karte hue suna, Abu Saeed Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam parda nashin kunwari larki se bhi zyada haya wale the, aur jab Aap kisi cheez ko napasand karte to hum use Aap ke chehre me pehchan lete."
"468","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, Qaboos se, ke un ke walid ne un se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Nek rahnumai aur sanjeeda wazar aur miyanaravi nabuwwat ke sattar hisson me se ek hissa hai."
"469","Hafs bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Miqdam se, un ke walid se, Ayesha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek oont par sawar thi jis me sarkashi thi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Narmi ko lazim pakro, kyunke woh kisi cheez me nahi hoti magar use zeenat bakhshti hai, aur kisi cheez se nahi nikali jati magar use aibdar karti hai."
"470","Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waleed bin Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Rafe se, Saeed Maqburi se, un ke walid se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Bakhl o hirs se bacho, kyunke us ne tum se pehle logon ko halak kiya, unhon ne apne khoon bahaye aur apne rishton ko qata kiya, aur zulm Qayamat ke din andheron hoga."
"471","Harami bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Kaseer bin Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Ummul Momineen Ayesha raziyallahu anha ki khidmat me hazir hua to unhon ne kaha: Thahro yahan tak ke main apni naqba see loon, pas main thahra raha, phir maine kaha: Aye Ummul Momineen, agar main bahar ja kar unhein bata doon to woh isay aap ki taraf se bakhl shumar karenge, unhon ne kaha: Apna kaam dekho, beshak jo purana libas na pehne us ke liye naya nahi hai."
"472","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid se, Hasan se, Abdullah bin Mughaffal se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Rafiq hai narmi ko pasand karta hai, aur us par woh ata karta hai jo sakhti par ata nahi karta."
"473","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Tayyah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aasani karo aur tangi na karo, aur taskeen do aur nafrat na dilao."
"474","Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jareer ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Bani Israel me ek mehman utra, aur ghar me un ki ek kuttiya thi, to unhon ne kaha: Aye kuttiya, hamare mehman par na bhonk, to us ke pet me pille bolne lage, phir unhon ne apne ek nabi se is ka zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha: Beshak is ki misal us ummat ki si hai jo tumhare baad hogi, jis ke bewaqoof us ke ulama par ghalib aa jayenge."
"475","Kaseer bin Ubaid rahimahullah se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Main Ummul Momineen Ayesha raziyallahu anha ki khidmat me hazir hua to unhon ne kaha: Thahro yahan tak ke main apni chadar see loon, Kaseer ne kaha: Pas main thahra raha, phir maine kaha: Aye Ummul Momineen, agar main bahar ja kar logon ko bata doon ke aap purana kapra pehne hue hain to woh ise aap ka bakhl shumar karenge, to unhon ne kaha: Baat ko samjho, aur asal baat yeh hai ke jo purana kapra na pehne us ka naye kapre me koi haq nahi hai."
"476","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala lateef rafeeq hai, narmi ko pasand farmata hai, aur narmi par woh ata farmata hai jo sakhti par ata nahin farmata."
